WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.900
Hello there.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Let me ask, are you a financial services professional or licensed insurance agent
that has clients concerned about the future costs of long-term care

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.800
and where their care might be needed?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Maybe you're just someone concerned whether or not your assets will last
in the event of a chronic health challenge, and more importantly, what will be the consequences

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
to your family if and when long-term care is required in the future.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.500
If you are either one and you don't know where to start,
consider taking this short online assessment.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.500
The assessment can be customized, or it can be run incognito
without disclosing any personal contact or financial information.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:43.500
In fact, once the assessment is completed, you can view it privately
and then download it to your personal computer or digital device.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.500
No personal or financial information is retained
on any servers or this platform.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.200
So go on and see for yourself how this tool could be helpful
in long-term care planning.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:54.800
You'll be glad you did.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Oh, one more thing before I leave.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:03.000
If you are in the insurance or financial services industry
and want to license and brand this tool, give us a call.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.500
Our information is provided and viewable within the terms of use.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.630
Thank you.
